# ChoresNest v1.0.8

## Highlights
- Reworked the grocery export modal so categories appear as a uniform, horizontally scrollable selector with arrow hints, consistent heights, and selectable chips before the export style options.
- Added bulk multi-select helpers to the purchased-category detail view, allowing users to pick any items (or use Select all) before moving them back to the current bag.
- Ensured the grocery row component tolerates the new selection props, keeping the bundle stable even when `isSelectable` is absent.
